---
// "Impulse vs Logic" — echoes the split-brain logo in layout form.
---

<section class="relative px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <p class="reveal text-center text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/40">
      The problem
    </p>
    <h2 class="reveal mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-balance text-center text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">
      Every bad decision feels urgent in the moment.
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-center text-white/60 sm:text-lg">
      Your mind has two sides. One wants it right now. The other knows better — but
      it always shows up too late.
    </p>

    <div class="reveal mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-0">
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-linear-to-br from-red/10 to-transparent p-8 sm:rounded-r-none sm:border-r-0"
      >
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-red">Impulse</span>
        <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Wants it now.</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-white/55">
          <li>Fast, loud, sure of itself</li>
          <li>The 2 a.m. “yes”</li>
          <li>The all-in bet</li>
          <li>The full cart at checkout</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-linear-to-br from-blue/10 to-transparent p-8 sm:rounded-l-none"
      >
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-blue">Logic</span>
        <p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Weighs the cost.</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-white/55">
          <li>Slow, calm, patient</li>
          <li>Remembers what you actually want</li>
          <li>Counts the real price</li>
          <li>Shows up — usually too late</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-lg text-white/75">
      Cogent gives the calm side time to catch up.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
